    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'General

    - The goal of this game is to survive as long as possible

    -
    The longer you survive, the higher your score

    - Speed will pickup the longer
    you play

    - When playing, obsticles will spawn. They instantly kill you


    Controls

    -
    Press A and D to evade.

    - Press S to duck.

    - Press space to jump.


    Power
    ups

    - During gameplay, power ups will appear.

    - A shield allows you
    to tank one hit, then it will disappear.

    - A 2x score multiplier will double
    your score.

    - Upgrades increases the spawn rate and duration of power ups

    -
    Each upgrade cost 100 coins'
